{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pets &amp; Stuff</strong>\u00a0\u2014  a cute, fun and relaxing game where you become a skilful groomer and veterinarian. Help little friends in trouble, make them happy, pampered, clean, well-fed, and don't forget to add a pinch of chic. Let your imagination run wild! Enjoy a fully responsive and polished gameplay, make the best trims, feel the fur at the end of your fingertips and capture the best photoshoots of your creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cuteness overload and furrrr everywhere guaranteed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are so many <strong>lovely animals</strong> here! Cats, dogs, raccoons, foxes, deer, and so many more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of products and tools available to <strong>treat and care</strong> for your little friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of cool accessories for the most <strong>stylish pets</strong> of all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple <strong>locations</strong>, with the ability to upgrade your clinic into the best of the best.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Flawless Virtuoso","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740110/8f89ad846b8afc624582475924864e94a249de93.jpg"},{"name":"Interior De-fur-ator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740110/8afdb40eb69adc3db9ed8dcf04b330fb0074a0d6.jpg"},{"name":"Woodland Wonder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740110/d0a711ca7a16ff9f1bf9b4bfd589fd4e28232093.jpg"},{"name":"Barnyard Beautifier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740110/84e79314005e2014a5e3f62216b54b6af45bf130.jpg"},{"name":"Fur-tographer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2740110/2